13},{"t":31.21,"dur":7,"clip":"13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"A retreat from the giant systems into a world they could build together.","kw":["retreat","giant","systems","world","could","build","together"],"ch":13},{"t":39.09,"dur":4,"clip":"13_open-standard/VR_interoperability_diagram_on_w…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/VR_interoperability_diagram_on_w…_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, engineers tried to build a seamless world.","kw":["engineers","tried","build","seamless","world"],"ch":13},{"t":47.99,"dur":4.24,"clip":"13_open-standard/Documentary_video_decentralized_…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Documentary_video_decentralized_…_202607101943.mp4","in":3.48,"text":"To build a digital world beyond the control of tech giants.","kw":["build","digital","world","beyond","control","tech","giants"],"ch":13},{"t":55.11,"dur":4,"clip":"13_open-standard/VR_tracker_building_2019_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/VR_tracker_building_2019_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, a small community began to build their own reality.","kw":["small","community","began","build","reality"],"ch":13},{"t":60.8,"dur":5.2,"clip":"13_open-standard/Haptic_feedback_device_tested_by…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Haptic_feedback_device_tested_by…_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, engineers began to test a new kind of digital interface.","kw":["engineers","began","test","kind","digital","interface"],"ch":13},{"t":68.71,"dur":3.76,"clip":"13_open-standard/Open-source_hardware_group_2019_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Open-source_hardware_group_2019_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, a new ideal began to emerge.","kw":["ideal","began","emerge"],"ch":13},{"t":77.76,"dur":5,"clip":"13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, they believed they could fix the system.","kw":["believed","could","system"],"ch":13},{"t":90.9,"dur":4,"clip":"13_open-standard/Glowing_white_lattice_structure_…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Glowing_white_lattice_structure_…_202607101943.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"where every system could talk to every other system.","kw":["where","every","system","could","talk","other"],"ch":13},{"t":98.92,"dur":4,"clip":"13_open-standard/Technology_standards_meeting_dev…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Technology_standards_meeting_dev…_202607101943.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"We need a standard where the whole network fractures.","kw":["need","standard","where","whole","network","fractures"],"ch":13},{"t":107.43,"dur":5,"clip":"13_open-standard/AI_conference_XR_architecture_di…_202607101905.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/AI_conference_XR_architecture_di…_202607101905.mp4","in":0,"text":"We need to ensure this architecture supports all run times.","kw":["need","ensure","architecture","supports","times"],"ch":13},{"t":115.19,"dur":5,"clip":"13_open-standard/Technology_standards_meeting_dev…_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Technology_standards_meeting_dev…_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"If we lock this protocol now, we lose all decentralized control.","kw":["lock","protocol","lose","decentralized","control"],"ch":13},{"t":128.49,"dur":5,"clip":"13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"But the code had already begun to rewrite power.","kw":["code","already","begun","rewrite","power"],"ch":13},{"t":136.2,"dur":3.56,"clip":"13_open-standard/Open-source_hardware_group_2019_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Open-source_hardware_group_2019_202607101943.mp4","in":3.64,"text":"They believed that code could create a newer, fairer world.","kw":["believed","code","could","create","newer","fairer","world"],"ch":13},{"t":142.69,"dur":5.16,"clip":"13_open-standard/People_debating_ownership_workshop_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/People_debating_ownership_workshop_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"But who actually owns that data?","kw":["actually","owns","data"],"ch":13},{"t":149.83,"dur":4.6,"clip":"13_open-standard/Body-tracking_research_in_lab_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Body-tracking_research_in_lab_202607101943.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 2019, scientists found a new way to capture the dance of human life.","kw":["scientists","found","capture","dance","human","life"],"ch":13}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[12.05,18.9,0.28],[24.12,25.37,0.28],[31.21,38.46,0.28],[39.09,43.34,0.28],[47.99,52.48,0.28],[55.11,59.36,0.28],[60.8,66.25,0.28],[68.71,72.72,0.28],[76.25,77.76,0.55],[77.76,83.01,0.28],[90.9,95.15,0.28],[98.92,103.17,0.28],[107.43,112.68,0.28],[115.19,120.44,0.28],[128.49,133.74,0.28],[136.2,140.01,0.28],[142.69,148.1,0.28],[149.83,154.68,0.28]],"coverage":0.805,"used":33,"pool":41,"speech":0.488,"eras":[13],"filmName":"SWEEP 27 FILM ch13"}